# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Recipe in Git, pixels in Drive.
#  Default is EXCLUDE. Curated reference material is opted back in at
#  the bottom. A file only earns a place here if it changes how the
#  work is MADE, not if it shows what it looked like.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Secrets — never, under any circumstance ────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.env.txt
env.txt
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
*-key.json

# ── Drive junctions / shortcuts ─────────────────────────────────────
_drive/
_drive

# ── Bulk binaries: output, not recipe ──────────────────────────────
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.avif
*.webp
*.gif
*.bmp
*.psd
*.psb
*.ai
*.eps
*.tif
*.tiff
*.pdf
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm

# ── Regenerable artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Review galleries embed base64 thumbnails and rebuild from the wave;
# contact sheets and format cuts rebuild from the wave folder.
delivery/review*.html
delivery/gallery*.html
_contact-sheet*.png
_formats/
_model-ready/

# ── Tooling / OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  OPT BACK IN — the text record inside the wave folders, and the
#  curated reference images.
#  Git never descends into an excluded directory, so wave folders are
#  re-included before any negation below can fire. Without the
#  trailing-slash line the manifests are silently dropped from every
#  commit.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
!.env.example
!evals/waves/**/
!evals/waves/**/*.md
!evals/waves/**/MANIFEST.jsonl
!evals/waves/**/qa_*.json
!evals/waves/**/picks*.json
!evals/waves/**/verdicts*.json
!references/**/*.jpg
!references/**/*.png
!references/**/*.svg
!skill/assets/**
